    "findings": "In duels the old Brutal edge was entirely its 30 ms faster reaction; edge pressure and the smaller aim error were worth nothing. Firing rate alone (castChance 1) helps less than firing at the right moment: punish keeps the fire rate (about 16 Fireballs a round either way) but raised its Fireball damage per cast against Hard from about 22 to 24 while Hard's fell from about 14 to 12. Without a Hard change, any punish strong enough for a 75% step over Hard left Uber only about 60% over Brutal (punish 0.2: 78% over Hard, Uber 57% over it, 200 matches), so Hard returned to the original cast rate (worth about 35 Elo; Hard still wins 98% of rounds over Medium)."
